# Barat Pay admin panel — copy to .env.local for local development.

# Public origin of the API as the BROWSER sees it. Leave unset: empty means
# "same origin", so the browser calls /api/... on the host serving the panel.
# nginx routes that to the API in production and next.config.ts rewrites it in
# development. Pointing this at a different site breaks login, because the staff
# session cookie is SameSite=Strict and would never be sent.
# API_PUBLIC_URL=

# Absolute address server components use, and the dev rewrite target. In Docker
# set it to the internal service address so RSC traffic never leaves the private
# network. Defaults to http://localhost:4000.
# API_INTERNAL_URL=http://api:4000
